{"4886080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anubis: Wrath of the Underworld", "steam_appid": 4886080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4917790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anubis is an isometric action-RPG in the spirit of Diablo, but set in the ancient Egyptian afterlife. Instead of playing as a survivor, you play as Anubis himself, a soul guide who faces the imbalance of the Duat and the rise of forgotten gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game focuses on close combat, dodging, and clever abilities rather than inventory management. Instead of hundreds of items, you find and upgrade relics that drastically change your playstyle and skill progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combat Anubis </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control the god of the dead himself: quick strikes, dashes, finishing moves, and the ability to hold your ground against crowds of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hybrid Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combine basic strikes, Dash, area of effect, and Anubis's special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relics of the Afterlife </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find artifacts from temples and tombs - relics that enhance abilities, add effects and allow you to collect your build for the style of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies of Duat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight with the revived mummies, clay golems, zoms</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anubis is an isometric action-RPG in the spirit of Diablo, but set in the ancient Egyptian afterlife. Instead of playing as a survivor, you play as Anubis himself, a soul guide who faces the imbalance of the Duat and the rise of forgotten gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game focuses on close combat, dodging, and clever abilities rather than inventory management. Instead of hundreds of items, you find and upgrade relics that d